      "content": "i get that it's casual, but i mean, is it actually \"unprofessional\" or just a different way of speaking? like, if we're looking at the grammar/structure, is it basically just \"bad\" English that we should fix, or is it just a specific style? i just want to know how to explain to my boss why we can't use it.",
